---
import ContentLayout from '../layouts/ContentLayout.astro';
import { SITE_CONFIG } from '../lib/config';
import { useTranslation, getLocaleFromUrl, getLocalizedPath } from '../i18n/utils';
import type { Locale } from '../i18n/languages';

interface Props {
  locale?: Locale;
}

const { locale } = Astro.props;
const currentLocale = locale || getLocaleFromUrl(Astro.url);
const t = useTranslation(currentLocale);
const contactUrl = getLocalizedPath('/contact/', currentLocale);
const privacyUrl = getLocalizedPath('/privacy-policy/', currentLocale);
---

<ContentLayout
  title={t.pages.terms.title}
  description={t.pages.terms.description}
  locale={currentLocale}
  keywords="disposable email service, temporary email generator, receive only temp mail, developer api terms"
>
  <p>
    <strong>Last Updated:</strong> August 20, 2026
  </p>

  <p>
    Welcome to <strong>TempoEmails</strong> (accessible at <strong>{SITE_CONFIG.domain}</strong>). These Terms of Service ("Terms") constitute a legally binding agreement between you ("User", "you", or "your") and TempoEmails ("we", "us", or "our") concerning your access to and use of the TempoEmails website and related disposable email routing services (collectively, the "Service").
  </p>

  <p>
    By accessing or using any part of TempoEmails, you agree that you have read, understood, and agreed to be bound by all of these Terms. <strong>If you do not agree with all of these Terms, you are expressly prohibited from using the Service and must discontinue use immediately.</strong>
  </p>

  <blockquote>
    <strong>Summary of Key Points:</strong> TempoEmails is a free, receive-only, temporary email service. We do not guarantee permanent message storage or message delivery. You may not use this service for illegal activities, harassment, spamming, financial fraud, or bypassing authentication security systems illicitly.
  </blockquote>

  <h2>1. Description of Service</h2>
  <p>
    TempoEmails provides internet users with on-demand, temporary, and anonymous email addresses. The primary purpose of the Service is to enable users to receive confirmation links, one-time passcodes (OTPs), and transient notifications without exposing their permanent personal or business email addresses to unwanted spam, data brokers, or marketing lists.
  </p>
  <p>
    Key functional attributes of the Service include:
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Receive-Only Architecture:</strong> TempoEmails is designed exclusively for incoming email reception. Outbound email sending is disabled to prevent outbound spam and abuse.</li>
    <li><strong>Ephemeral Lifespan:</strong> Generated addresses and received emails exist temporarily and are automatically purged after a predetermined expiration period.</li>
    <li><strong>No Account Creation:</strong> Standard mailbox access does not require username registration or password creation.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>2. Acceptable Use Policy</h2>
  <p>
    You agree to use TempoEmails strictly in compliance with all applicable local, national, and international laws, regulations, and industry standards. You agree to use the Service in good faith for legitimate privacy preservation, testing, development, and temporary communication verification.
  </p>

  <h2>3. Prohibited Activities</h2>
  <p>
    You may not access or use the Service for any purpose other than that for which we make it available. Prohibited activities include, but are not limited to:
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Illegal & Fraudulent Schemes:</strong> Engaging in credit card fraud, identity theft, unauthorized account creation, money laundering, or illegal marketplace transactions.</li>
    <li><strong>Phishing & Malware Distribution:</strong> Using the Service in connection with phishing campaigns, social engineering attacks, ransomware, trojans, or malicious script propagation.</li>
    <li><strong>System Abuse & Denial of Service:</strong> Attempting to overwhelm, flood, reverse engineer, decompile, or execute automated script attacks against TempoEmails infrastructure or connected API networks.</li>
    <li><strong>Circumventing Security Controls:</strong> Using disposable mailboxes to repeatedly bypass rate limits, ban lists, trial period restrictions, or security controls of third-party platforms in violation of their respective terms.</li>
    <li><strong>Harassment & Hate Speech:</strong> Facilitating harassment, stalking, defamatory campaigns, threats of violence, or hate speech against individuals or groups.</li>
    <li><strong>Botnet Operations & Scraping:</strong> Deploying headless crawlers, scrapers, or bot farms to mass-generate mailboxes or harvest data without explicit written consent.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>4. Service Availability, Changes, and Termination</h2>
  <p>
    We strive to provide uninterrupted service availability; however, you acknowledge and agree that:
  </p>
  <ol>
    <li>We reserve the absolute right to modify, suspend, throttle, or terminate the Service (or any feature thereof) at any time, with or without notice, for maintenance, security, or operational reasons.</li>
    <li>We regularly cycle, add, or retire email domain names. An address created under a specific domain may become unreachable if that domain is decommissioned.</li>
    <li>We reserve the right to block individual IP addresses, subnets, or mailbox aliases that violate these Terms or threaten service stability.</li>
  </ol>

  <h2>5. Intellectual Property Rights</h2>
  <p>
    Unless otherwise indicated, the TempoEmails website, brand assets, logos, design templates, icons, UI components, source code, and underlying software are proprietary intellectual property owned or licensed by TempoEmails, protected by applicable copyright, trademark, and intellectual property laws. You are granted a limited, non-exclusive, non-transferable license to access and use the Service for personal or internal business purposes.
  </p>

  <h2>6. Disclaimer of Warranties</h2>
  <p>
    <strong>THE SERVICE IS PROVIDED ON AN "AS-IS" AND "AS-AVAILABLE" BASIS. TO THE MAXIMUM EXTENT PERMITTED BY LAW, TEMPOEMAILS EXPRESSLY DISCLAIMS ALL WARRANTIES OF ANY KIND, WHETHER EXPRESS OR IMPLIED, INCLUDING BUT NOT LIMITED TO THE IMPLIED WARRANTIES OF MERCHANTABILITY, FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE, TITLE, AND NON-INFRINGEMENT.</strong>
  </p>
  <p>
    Without limiting the foregoing, we make no warranty that:
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>The Service will meet your specific business or personal requirements.</li>
    <li>Incoming emails will arrive without delay, error, omission, or corruption.</li>
    <li>Third-party websites or services will accept or deliver emails to TempoEmails domains.</li>
    <li>Emails will remain accessible or stored for any specific duration beyond default purge windows.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>7. Limitation of Liability</h2>
  <p>
    <strong>IN NO EVENT SHALL TEMPOEMAILS, ITS DIRECTORS, EMPLOYEES, AFFILIATES, OR PARTNERS BE LIABLE TO YOU OR ANY THIRD PARTY FOR ANY DIRECT, INDIRECT, CONSEQUENTIAL, EXEMPLARY, INCIDENTAL, SPECIAL, OR PUNITIVE DAMAGES, INCLUDING LOST PROFITS, LOST REVENUE, LOSS OF DATA, OR INTERRUPTED COMMUNICATIONS ARISING FROM YOUR USE OF OR INABILITY TO USE THE SERVICE.</strong>
  </p>
  <p>
    You explicitly acknowledge that disposable emails are public and unauthenticated. <strong>You assume all risks associated with any loss of access to third-party accounts, missed password reset emails, or expired verification links.</strong>
  </p>

  <h2>8. Indemnification</h2>
  <p>
    You agree to defend, indemnify, and hold harmless TempoEmails, its subsidiaries, affiliates, officers, and contractors from and against any claims, liabilities, damages, losses, and expenses (including reasonable attorney fees) arising out of or in any way connected with your breach of these Terms or your misuse of the Service.
  </p>

  <h2>9. Governing Law and Severability</h2>
  <p>
    These Terms shall be governed by and construed in accordance with the applicable laws of the jurisdiction in which TempoEmails operates, without regard to conflict of law principles. If any provision of these Terms is found to be unlawful, void, or unenforceable, that provision shall be deemed severable and shall not affect the validity and enforceability of any remaining provisions.
  </p>

  <h2>10. Modifications to Terms</h2>
  <p>
    We reserve the right to amend or update these Terms at our discretion. Any modifications become effective immediately upon posting to this page. Your continued use of the Service following posted revisions signifies your binding acceptance of the revised Terms.
  </p>

  <h2>11. Contact Information</h2>
  <p>
    If you have any questions or require legal clarification regarding these Terms of Service, please reach out:
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Email:</strong> <a href={`mailto:${SITE_CONFIG.emails.contact}`}>{SITE_CONFIG.emails.contact}</a></li>
    <li><strong>Support Desk:</strong> <a href={contactUrl}>Contact TempoEmails Support</a></li>
    <li><strong>Privacy Policy:</strong> <a href={privacyUrl}>Read Privacy Policy</a></li>
  </ul>
</ContentLayout>
